## Core Principles
Always validate addresses by chain type, use chain-specific libraries (viem for EVM, @solana/web3.js for Solana), never cast directly, RORO pattern, document formats, delegate to chain-specific rules

## Address Validation Pattern
Coordinates multichain validation. Delegate to chain-specific rules: validateAddress switches on chainType (evm/solana/cosmos). See chain-specific rules for implementation

## Chain-Specific Libraries
EVM: @.cursor/rules/web3/viem.mdc (getAddress from viem v2.44.4), Solana: @.cursor/rules/web3/solana.mdc (PublicKey from @solana/web3.js v1.98.4), Cosmos: @.cursor/rules/web3/cosmos.mdc (Bech32)

## Error Handling
Chain-aware error messages: Invalid address format for chain type

## Best Practices
Validate early (before transactions), chain-aware errors, use libraries (not custom regex), document formats, fail fast

